      "data": {
        "text": "**Considering User Registration**\n\nI'm focusing on user registration and account creation. I've decided on Firebase Authentication as the external provider. Now, I'm thinking about how to integrate it concretely into the `register_user.py` file to handle new user email/password creation effectively.\n\n\n**Implementing User Registration**\n\nI'm now concretely implementing the `register_user.py` file. The plan is to create a `register_user` function that uses the `firebase_admin` SDK. This function will take the email and password and will create the new user with Firebase Authentication. I will ensure that the code explicitly imports `firebase_admin` as a signal of its use.\n\n\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789887236728,
          "start": 1789887235380
        },
        "type": "reasoning"
      },
